Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Short .kk, darling, detached,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.33,0:00:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now! Full
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,speed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to show you ,Dans
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Known as Save, I hope the light you desire
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.21,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We expect it to keep.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.50,0:00:31.76,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fresh. At this paradise.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.06,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,continued...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.12,0:02:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've only arrived with Matt who got\Ntired to stop feeling sorry for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.18,0:02:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We headed off to find Agumon.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.47,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx125\fscy125\pos(313,319)}Blue Thunder, Lighdramon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.56,0:02:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aoi Inazuma, Paildramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've got my\Nair force and my armor,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.44,0:02:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm conquering more and\Nmore territories each day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With these new and improved Dark Rings,\Nnot only will I control MetalGreymon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but all other Digimon as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.26,0:02:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're ready for a fight now\Ntoo, aren't you? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Tentomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.82,0:02:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.24,0:02:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just love riding trains!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the dining car?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An email from Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.62,0:02:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has he found them yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently Ken and MetalGreymon\Nhave been seen south of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on the right track.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, technically, Matt,\Nwe're on the only track.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Digidestined, this time\Nwe'll get Agumon back for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.88,0:03:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's no way that\NKen can stop all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, but, just in case,\NTentomon, I need your help. Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.68,0:03:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was gonna have my shell waxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to go and search for Garurumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll be back in a flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.89,0:03:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you're planning\Nfor us to fight Metal Greymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all of us together,\NI think we stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are just some things\Nthat have to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.40,0:03:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right, Tai? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think we'll be able\Nto defeat Cannon Metal Dramon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think we can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.52,0:03:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who asked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm speaking from experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to fight because if we\Ndon't, we'll never save Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you so afraid of anyway, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.76,0:03:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who said anything about being afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't want to see Agumon get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all, T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one said we have to hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:03:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is get\Nrid of that dark ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.14,0:03:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how do you propose we remove it,\Nespecially without hurting Agumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any bright ideas under that fancy hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I'm trying, Gogglehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't make fun of my hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.24,0:04:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.46,0:04:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I have to separate you two\Nlike a couple of children?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.73,0:04:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that bad for team morale?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Matt and I were younger,\Nwe fought a lot, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we hadn't fought\Nall those times we probably
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never would have become such\Ngood friends So just let
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.62,0:04:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them fight it out of their\Nsystems leave it to boys
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to think they have to fight\Nto become friends Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the best way to make friends is\Nover a good game of checkers sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.68,0:04:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get the winner
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for now what we need\Nto do is catch up to cat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where could he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.19,0:04:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's either the biggest\Nsundial I've ever seen
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:05:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or it's one of the Digimon\NEmperor's control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold your horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A squadron of Pagumon and they're all\Nbeing controlled by those dark rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely going to need some backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to find Garurumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't this thing go any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.82,0:05:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My D3 has found a digi-egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, don't just sit\Nthere and hit the brakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who could have carved that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone with a really big chisel?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It kind of looks like\Nmy crest of friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but why would someone go to the trouble\Nof carving that into the side of a wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the egg's in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bigfoot was here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.44,0:05:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like a flip-flop\Nwith a bent nail in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has everyone had a tetanus shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got that same symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, it definitely has the Crest\Nof Friendship on it, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.44,0:05:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's meant for you, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.24,0:05:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe it's meant for the\None with the most friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:06:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe it's meant for the\None with the fewest friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.64,0:06:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone should try to pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.12,0:06:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, what's the\Nworst that could happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it could be a trap set\Nup by the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.94,0:06:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think it would be booby-trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, it's emblazoned\Nwith the Crest of Friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I think you should go for it, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.14,0:06:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wish me luck, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.58,0:06:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.50,0:06:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, why don't you give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have had a bigger breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.20,0:06:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.11,0:06:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your turn. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.32,0:06:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lift, Tai, lift!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lift, Tai, lift!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.74,0:06:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lift, Tai, lift!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.43,0:06:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of you is next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.32,0:06:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:06:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you guys are going\Nabout this all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you think you can lift it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you just have to use physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, in physics, there's this\Nlittle thing called equilibrium.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you have two libriums that\Nweigh the same, they're equilibrium.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.10,0:07:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes perfect sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, you know, Tai, I was\Njust making that stuff up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't know\Nanything about physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I usually leave all that stuff up to\Nprofessors and scientists and Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd take me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sick of all\Nyour blabbering, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.78,0:07:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who hasn't\Ntried yet, so just get in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, lift that digi-egg up\Nso we can get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I could have put my eye out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, this shouldn't be too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, uh, I\Ncan't do it, I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, what's that terrible noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.96,0:07:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hurting my ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.87,0:07:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.48,0:08:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly stink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boys and girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Golemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing worse than his deadly sting
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attack is the noise he\Nmakes when attacking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I hear him coming, I usually\Njust dig a hole until he blows over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.40,0:08:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it! Right, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.26,0:08:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.86,0:08:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.90,0:08:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fladramon, the Fire of Courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.30,0:09:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon, Armor Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.96,0:09:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armored!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holsmon, the wings of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempest Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.36,0:09:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here he comes again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.52,0:09:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon is gone! Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.34,0:09:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said help! Wait on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.70,0:09:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon will save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.74,0:09:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's getting away! Panamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we're gaining!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Greymon! TK!\NDavis! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a new play toy, you evil miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.44,0:10:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.35,0:10:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just getting started with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.34,0:10:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got more dark rings!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he have planned?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.82,0:10:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could be sure it's something bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I put this on your\Nlittle friend here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will have complete control over him,\Nand I can make him do anything I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you do my\Nlaundry one piece at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then I'll never let\Nyou get away with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.50,0:11:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't interrupt me while\NI'm planning my evil deeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Fladramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might accidentally\Nmiss and hit Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm such a hothead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we have to separate\NPatamon and the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see how we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to try. Oh, yeah? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can trap him by using you as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.94,0:11:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.85,0:11:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to be the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.77,0:11:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to use some kind of\Nbait that we can do without.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.06,0:11:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.97,0:11:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we can easily do without your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.57,0:11:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's a good time to remember\Nthe crest of friendship, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to see how this turns out,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.84,0:11:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've got to run I have a\Nfew chores to take care of,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like taking over the digital world\NThere's no way we're going to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.14,0:11:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let you use Patamon to help you\Nwith your plan That goes for Agumon,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.90,0:11:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.81,0:11:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really funny, because I\Ndon't remember asking for permission
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.82,0:11:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really should have\NFlymon trim his nails back
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hold still,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a few seconds you will remember a\Nthing Except what it's like to be my slave
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice going!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon, you came just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K.! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panama, how do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinda like a big piece of dental\Nfloss, but other than that, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to hand it to TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.36,0:12:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really risked himself to save Panama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.10,0:12:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.34,0:12:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you try to protect me\Nif I was in danger, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.28,0:12:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about definitely?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.48,0:12:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys are going to make me cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really want a\Ntest of your friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be more than happy to give you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for the fight of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to Metal Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.54,0:12:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon and I are going to try to get\Nthose rings off Metal Greymon's arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Squash them like a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.72,0:13:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon, that was close, but we've got\Nto attack him with all of our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.90,0:13:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of hurting MetalGreymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.32,0:13:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.72,0:13:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't use our full power,\Nhe'll crush us like grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.66,0:13:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Matt, it's time to\Ncall in the cavalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor, enter, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.32,0:13:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, Armor Digivolve, too
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digiloman, series\NDigimon, are the champions
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.10,0:13:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armagilloman, armor, Digivolve
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.92,0:13:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, armor, armor, armor,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.44,0:13:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters! Digimon, the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, the drill of power! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor-Armored, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotsumon, Armored Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.52,0:14:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.56,0:14:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nefertimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The angel of light! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.40,0:14:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosetta Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempest Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful, you heard him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did what you had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're getting annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.84,0:14:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howling Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Greymon, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're only doing this out of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to help them fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.76,0:15:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a chance I'll hurt MetalGreymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.84,0:15:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't understand about friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.30,0:15:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, V-mon, oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daisuke, you have to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.80,0:15:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you just stand there\Nand let him try to hurt me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.54,0:15:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lay off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.68,0:15:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.42,0:15:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not about what you want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about the things you\Nhave to do for friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. Huh? Friendship?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to try one more time to\Nremove those rings from your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, Garurumon, do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK and Tai both have such a\Ndeep bond with their Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.30,0:15:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much deeper than I would\Nhave ever imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have taken a lot\Nfor Tai to be able to say
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:16:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we had no other choice but\Nto attack Metal Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you, Vimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.10,0:16:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm keeping track.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.22,0:16:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vimon, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is, but no thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon risked his life to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.58,0:16:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all you did was stand there and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.66,0:16:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TKI.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.94,0:16:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm beginning to understand\Nwhat makes friendship so powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to be willing to do\Nwhatever it takes to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because they would do the same for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neemon, I'm your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.62,0:16:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is new.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His Digivice is responding\Nto the new Digi-Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.86,0:16:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.44,0:16:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's stopped right in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.12,0:16:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your digi-egg of friendship, Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My digi-egg of friendship?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis already has the digi-egg of courage,\Nso how can he now have another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.40,0:17:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that means that Vemon\Ncan become twice as powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can win now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's give it a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.82,0:17:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor, energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.06,0:17:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-Mon, armor, Digi-Bomb, Doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.36,0:17:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor, Digi-Bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wargreymon, the storm of friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Paildramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As V-mon, I use the Digi-Egg of\NFriendship to armor Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.78,0:17:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My blue thunder and electric bite\Nattacks annihilate my enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.74,0:17:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, someone who can\Nstand up to the Antworm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.90,0:17:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show him who's in charge here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.60,0:17:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.56,0:18:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.06,0:18:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't come off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your weak attempts make me laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.96,0:18:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.10,0:18:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.08,0:18:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get him back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Garurumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.60,0:18:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, this is a team effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.10,0:18:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're both going to attack\Nhim at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.10,0:18:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.01,0:18:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure. Not sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.74,0:18:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time you're gonna\Ndo things the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I? It must.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll fight together. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this time I've been worried about\Nwhat's best for me and not the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.12,0:18:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you guys can count\Non me now. Let's go! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.77,0:18:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's give it our best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, we fight to win. Good luck, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.72,0:19:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry we attacked you, Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.04,0:19:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.64,0:19:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that you're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.70,0:19:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sorry that you're\Nsorry that I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.98,0:19:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell you what, I won't be sorry anymore,\Nand you don't be sorry either, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.86,0:19:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, you saved the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought you were wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.54,0:19:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but I'm getting\Nout of here before he throws up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.36,0:19:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, you saved Agumon and you didn't\Neven lose a single hair. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they were able to\Ndefeat one of my new dark spirals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to have to\Nmake them even more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ken, is it okay\Nif I drive for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:20:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said once we took over the\NDigi-World and I could drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times have I told you,\Nwhen I'm thinking, don't talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I am always thinking, so never talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are evil geniuses\Nalways surrounded by fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, we managed to get\NAgumon back safe and sound,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we can't relax with\NKen still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.56,0:20:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon, I need you to be a spy\Nand find out what he's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.82,0:20:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Mon. Tentomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.98,0:20:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, two digi-eggs? That's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, thanks a lot for saving Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.80,0:20:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who, me? A friend?\NThat's right. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're officially part of the team now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.18,0:20:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for a noogie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.86,0:20:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.32,0:20:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a noogie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.30,0:20:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means I'm one of the guys now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.10,0:20:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're one of the guys now, does that\Nmean you used to be one of the girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how come you never told me about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you humans would\Njust make up your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then how's this for a friendship?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not the only one\Nwho's got a lot to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.86,0:20:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great. Teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.18,0:21:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll learn soon enough, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.38,0:21:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just take it one step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.26,0:21:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting with the noogies. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.08,0:21:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.58,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.70,0:21:28.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.69,0:21:34.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.06,0:21:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little weird.\NI can understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.16,0:21:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm getting\Nhome That's the day
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.40,0:21:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of the night It's almost
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.24,0:21:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I'm not feeling\Nthat I'm getting home.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.77,0:21:46.79,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.06,0:21:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I feel that I'm feeling good. I\Nknow I'm feeling good. I'm feeling bad,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.79,0:21:52.62,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.80,0:21:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm not sure
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.62,0:21:58.35,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.35,0:22:04.34,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.34,0:22:10.24,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.24,0:22:19.10,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.70,0:22:29.50,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.06,0:22:57.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx115\fscy115\pos(318,315)}Duel on the Digimon Ranch

